Its team structure is built around three disciplines: chartered accountants who check the underlying facts, figures and risks of a business, tax experts who handle tax-related queries, planning and strategy, and lawyers who ensure the legal side of a sale or valuation is handled properly with no loopholes. A free valuation calculator is available on the company''s website for an initial estimate. Based in Elardus Park, Pretoria, Check Your Business Value suits owners buying, selling or planning the future of an SME who need an affordable, locally relevant valuation.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://checkyourbusinessvalue.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'check-your-business-value-elardus-park' AND description = 'Check Your Business Value, based in Elardus Park, Pretoria, provides business valuation and business plan development services for small and medium enterprises, drawing on chartered accountants, tax specialists and lawyers, and also offers a free basic valuation calculator on its website.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
-- chimu-log-homes-amandasig (researched)
