Because Wendy houses can typically be built without a permit, they are popular as home offices, hobby rooms, guest cabins or simple storage space, and the company notes they are especially favoured at campsites, resorts and guest ranches for their warmth and the smell of real wood. Based in Amandasig, Pretoria, Chimu Log Homes suits homeowners, resorts and campsite operators wanting a durable, budget-friendly wooden or Nutec structure built to last rather than a basic prefab shed.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://chimu.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'chimu-log-homes-amandasig' AND description = 'Chimu Log Homes (CHIMU Construction) is a family-run building company based in Akasia that designs and builds log homes, Wendy houses, Nutec cabins, cottages, sheds and classrooms using CCA-treated pine and Nutec materials, with standard structures typically completed in 3-7 days.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
