Its additional services include polishing of brass, copper, aluminium and stainless steel, gun coating, vibratory finishing of small parts, stripping old plating, paint or powder coating, de-rusting metal parts and glass bead blasting. Based in Hermanstad, Pretoria, CJLM Electroplating suits workshops, collectors and hobbyists needing specialised metal finishing work that goes well beyond a standard chrome-plating shop.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.cjlmelectroplating.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'cjlm-electroplating-cc-hermanstad' AND description = 'CJLM Electroplating CC is an electroplating plant in Hermanstad, Pretoria with over 40 years in the industry, applying plating and finishes (including chrome, brass, and black oxide) to metal parts such as motorcycle and car components, badges, and trophy skull mounts.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
