The firm also establishes control survey networks, the fundamental horizontal and vertical position data that other surveys and construction projects rely on for accuracy. Based in Waterkloof Glen, Pretoria, Compass Land Surveyors suits developers, conveyancers and property owners needing precise, legally recognised survey work for subdivisions, consolidations or boundary disputes rather than a general-purpose surveying service.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.clsurveyors.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'compass-land-surveyors-waterkloof-glen' AND description = 'Compass Land Surveyors is a professional land surveying firm in Waterkloof Glen, Pretoria, offering cadastral surveys (boundary relocation, subdivisions, consolidations), control survey networks, topographical surveys, aerial drone surveys, and construction and engineering surveys for residential, commercial, agricultural, and public sector projects.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
