Beyond hardware, Compleo supplies A3 and A4 colour and black-and-white multifunction printers and document scanners for everyday office use, alongside business connectivity services covering fibre, microwave, 5G and LTE, cloud VOIP and IT services, and hardware rental finance options. Based in Centurion, Compleo suits businesses needing both their print infrastructure and their connectivity and communications handled by a single supplier, including those preferring to turn office printers into productivity tools through dedicated apps.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.compleo.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'compleo-doringkloof' AND description = 'Compleo is an office equipment and digital printing supplier offering production printing solutions, multifunction printers, wide-format printers, document scanners, workflow and document management solutions, plus business connectivity, hosting, and voice/video communication services, based at Byls Bridge Office Park in Centurion.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
